                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "kNQoL",
                      "name": "cmp/AttachmentChip",
                      "context": "A file queued for upload, before the resource it belongs to exists. Name, size, then a remove x — h 20 on the chip surface so it sits with cmp/Chip, with the right inset opened to 4 to seat the icon.\n\nRemoval has to be reachable from the chip itself: between picking a file and submitting the form there is no other surface where a mistaken attachment can be taken back. Image files reveal a preview popover when the name is clicked, so the chip is also how you confirm you picked the right screenshot.\n\nOwned by @pstdio/ui, not by any one extension — the create dialog is its first caller, not its home.",
                      "reusable": true,
                      "fill": "$ds-bg-subtle",
