                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "Hcvy6",
                      "name": "cmp/KanbanRendererListRow",
                      "context": "The unit of the detailed list display. h 34 — denser than cmp/ListRow (40) because the list is a scanning surface, not a nav. Every ticket row begins with its configured 16px status icon, matching the corresponding board column icon and color. The icon, shorthand ID, and title use 10px gaps. The mono ID is content-sized at 10px and always shows the human-readable shorthand (for example PS-171), never the storage UUID. It appears once before the title and must not be repeated as an attribute tag. Attributes ride right as chips + badge + date + assignee, in that order; each is independently disableable so the Display menu can hide a property without reflowing the ones that remain. Row is a tree node: rows sit under a group header and inherit its indent.",
