                      "id": "TlakR",
                      "name": "cmp/ChatToolTimeline",
                      "context": "An expanded Shell tool call. The row title is always `Shell` followed by the command, so the most useful input remains readable while collapsed. Expanding reveals only the command output. Never repeat the command inside the expandable block and never add separate Input/Output labels.\n\nOutput is mono and does not wrap — long test lines run past the right edge and clip. The block clips; expand or scroll for the rest.\n\nColour carries only status: green checks on passing lines, $ds-error on failures. Everything else stays fg.muted so the block reads as a quiet transcript. See cmp/ChatToolDiff for the patch equivalent.",
